SC["a2c8_hou_win"]={t:()=>P(`Hou ends the match flat on his back with your last knot still glowing across his chest, staring at the sky with an expression of profound theological difficulty. He has spent nine years learning that nothing moves a braced Pine-Crane stance, and the gold-haired servant just took it apart like a badly packed crate.`)+P(`He finds you afterward at the water-barrels — most fighters wouldn't — and gives you the full falling-tree salute, this time slowly enough that you can see the bruise blooming where his bracing failed. “Little brother,” he says. “What school?” You tell him the kitchens. He laughs for a long time, and decides not to believe you, which is the politest possible outcome.`),
 c:()=>[{id:"c0",l:`Walk him through where his bracing cracked — a fighter's debt, paid in trade.`,do:()=>{G.f.a2_grace=true;note("Hou's whole hall stops laughing at the servant that afternoon. The Pine-Crane bench cheers your next match. Crowds are weather, and the wind just shifted.");},go:"a2c8_ring"},
  {id:"c1",l:`Replay the fight all night: WHERE the iron seam ran, and why your fists rang off it.`,do:()=>{addIns(1);},go:"a2c8_ring"}]};

SC["a2c8_hou_lose"]={t:()=>P(`The temple door closes on you one exchange too early. You wake on the medics' mat with your knuckles wrapped and the bracket clerk explaining, in the bored voice of a man who explains things all day, that the trials run a loser's ladder: the beaten fight up through the consolation rounds, and the stubborn ones rejoin the main draw at the quarterfinal. The basement's whole rooting interest is now legally obligated to attend twice as many matches. Bao looks ten years older.`)+P(`You fight up through the consolation draw in three bouts over two days, and they are ugly, instructive bouts — no sword-qi geniuses down here, just hard people with debts of their own who want the robes exactly as much as you do.`),
 c:()=>[{id:"c0",l:`Spend the nights replaying Hou's bracing until you can see the iron seam with your eyes shut.`,do:()=>{addIns(1);},go:"a2c8_ring"},
  {id:"c1",l:`Spend the nights letting Bao feed you and lie to you about how good you looked.`,do:()=>{G.bao++;G.hp=Math.min(G.maxhp,G.hp+4);note("Bao +1. +4 HP. He does both jobs magnificently.");},go:"a2c8_ring"}]};

SC["a2c8_ring"]={t:()=>P(`Between rounds, the weather turns.`)+P(`The ring two terraces down has stopped finding the servant funny, because the servant is now the worst liability on its books: every grey-robe on the mountain bet against you at forty to one, and the wine-shop's slate is bleeding. Large men with small eyes have started attending your matches with the unhappy attention of creditors. And Bao's ask — unanswered since the wood-yard — is standing next to you at the rail, pretending to watch the formation bracket.`)+((G.f.a1_bao_debts)?(P(`He doesn't repeat it. He just exists at you, a man with a tripled debt and a friend who knows the future, and lets the silence do the asking. The slate figure you watched him thumb away is between you on the rail, invisible and load-bearing.`)):(P(`He doesn't repeat it. But the men buying his wine have stopped buying and started standing very close when they talk to him, and he exists at you along the rail, cheerful as a cracked bell, letting the silence do the asking.`))),
 c:()=>[{id:"c0",l:`Give him your certainty: how the semifinal goes, before it goes.`,do:()=>{G.f.a2_ring="fed";G.bao+=2;note("Bao +2. His debts clear in one afternoon of careful, distributed bets. Somewhere in a wine-shop, a clerk's row of figures now exists with your name running through it like a watermark — a thread anyone could pull, if anyone thought to look.");},go:"a2c8_lin_pre"},
  {id:"c1",l:`Refuse — flatly, finally, so it can never be asked again.`,do:()=>{G.f.a2_ring="cold";G.bao=Math.max(0,G.bao-2);note("Bao −2. He nods like you've confirmed the weather, thanks you for nothing in particular, and watches strangers get rich on your next win from the cheap rail. It is the coldest he has ever been at you, and the worst part is how polite it is.");},go:"a2c8_lin_pre"},
  {id:"c2",l:`Stake him instead: pledge your victor's purse against his slate. No knowledge passes — just everything you haven't won yet.`,do:()=>{G.f.a2_ring="staked";G.bao++;note("Bao +1. He argues for an hour and takes it, because the men with small eyes don't care where silver comes from. You are now fighting for robes you've already spent. Wonderful for focus, the pledge.");},go:"a2c8_lin_pre"}]};

SC["a2c8_lin_pre"]={t:()=>P(`Round of sixteen: Whisper-Step Lin, of no hall anyone names, who has won every match this tournament by being absent from it — opponents swing, she has already left, somewhere a judge sighs and scores the exchange. The crowd loves her the way crowds love rain at someone else's festival.`)+P(`You have one evening, and a choice about whose homework to do.`),
 c:()=>[{id:"c0",l:`Find her practice terrace and read her current — where the meltwater rises from, before she ever takes the form.`,req:()=>(G.insight>=6),rq:"(needs Insight 6)",do:()=>{G.f.a2_lin_read=true;note("An hour in the cold, watching. Her flow isn't formless — it pours FROM somewhere, the same wellspring every time, left hip, like a stream remembering its source. You could stand at that spring before she does.");},go:"a2c8_lin"},
  {id:"c1",l:`Rest. Eat Tang's soup. Let your threads refill and your bruises argue themselves quiet.`,do:()=>{G.hp=Math.min(G.maxhp,G.hp+6);note("+6 HP. The white soup pot, Tang says, is for people who work. She fills your bowl twice.");},go:"a2c8_lin"}]};

SC.a2c8_lin={img:"trials",combat:"lin",win:"a2c8_lin_win",lose:"a2c8_lin_lose",
 t:()=>P("The gong sounds, and Lin is already not where the gong said she was.")+
 SYS("Her meltwater form sheds knots and edges \u2014 but a flowing thing cannot brace. Plain fists break a current."),
 cstart:()=>{if(G.f.a2_lin_read){C.i=1;clog('<span class="good">You are standing at her wellspring before she takes the form \u2014 she opens flat-footed, current unset.</span>');}}};


SC["a2c8_lin_win"]={t:()=>P(`You end it with your fists, which is the part nobody in the stands can believe — the servant who took apart Pine-Crane bracing with sorcery nobody saw chooses to <i>box</i> the unboxable girl, wading into the current and breaking it with plain hands every time it tries to rise. When the judges call it, Lin looks at you with the bright, offended delight of a riddle that has met its answer.`)+P(`“Nobody reads me,” she says at the rail afterward, less an objection than a question.`),
 c:()=>[{id:"c0",l:`“Water takes no knot. But every stream has a spring.” Tell her the truth of how, minus the gold.`,do:()=>{G.f.a2_lin_friend=true;note("Lin grins like a knife coming out of a sheath. “Come find me when this is over, kitchen-school. I want to learn your footwork.” You have, possibly, made the strangest friend on the mountain.");},go:"a2c8_hulan"},
  {id:"c1",l:`Bow, say nothing, and keep the mechanism. Mystery is armor.`,do:()=>{addIns(1);},go:"a2c8_hulan"}]};

SC["a2c8_lin_lose"]={t:()=>P(`She reads your reading of her, in the end — flows from the wrong spring once, on purpose, and the feint costs you the match point. The crowd gets its rain. The loser's ladder gets its most famous customer back.`)+P(`You fight up through the consolation draw again, and this time the hard people down there fight you like a final, because beating the servant is the only odds left paying anything. You make the quarterfinal with your robes torn and your reputation, somehow, larger — the boy who keeps coming back up the loser's ladder is a better story than any clean run.`),
 c:()=>[{id:"c0",l:`What did her feint teach you about your own tells? Take the lesson apart until dawn.`,do:()=>{addIns(1);},go:"a2c8_hulan"},
  {id:"c1",l:`Let it go. Sleep. The bracket ahead has Iron Veil Ruan in it, and bruises make bad armor.`,do:()=>{G.hp=Math.min(G.maxhp,G.hp+6);note("+6 HP.");},go:"a2c8_hulan"}]};

SC["a2c8_hulan"]={t:()=>P(`The quarterfinal is a tall inner-court boy with a named sword and a manual older than your village, and it is over faster than your first match — there is a moment, mid-exchange, when you feel the whole tournament's worth of lessons settle into your hands at once, bracing and current and seam, and after that he is simply a problem you have already solved.`)+P(`Dusk comes down on the terraces gold and blue, lanterns budding along the balustrades one by one, the snow on the far roofs taking the last light the way paper takes ink. From the top of the stands the brackets look like what they are: a loom, names for threads, the whole noisy day weaving one cloth nobody at the bottom of it can see. You stand in the cold and look until looking is enough.`)+P(`Hu Lan finds you there — root-red Hu Lan from the trial line, two brackets over in the palm division, out in the round of eight, knuckles split and festival dress traded for fighting greys. Her family's grain-debt died the day she touched the jade; she fights, she says, for the families still on the rolls. She looks at you a long moment, miller's arithmetic behind her eyes.`)+P(`“They're saying Kang's first disciple is in your half of the draw,” she says. “The whole basement is betting its soup on you, river-ghost. The ones who can't afford to lose it. That's not pressure,” she adds, turning to go, “that's just so you know what the robes already cost.”`),
 c:()=>[{id:"c0",l:`Semifinals tomorrow. On the far stage, an iron veil is being measured for you.`,go:"c3t_watch"}]};